    "text_full": "Solutions\nTools\nIntegrations\nResources\nPricing\nGet a demo\nLogin\nRegister\nIP ALERT EXTENSION\nIP-Alert® Extension\n\nEasily identify and avoid risky Amazon products and brands with potential intellectual property issues. Stay ahead of intellectual property risks and keep your business running smoothly.\n\nInstall for Chrome\nHOW IT WORKS\n4 simple steps to get started\nInstall\n\nInstall the extension in your Chrome Browser\n\nSign Up\n\nCreate a personal account in Seller Assistant\n\nCheck\n\nOpen a search or product page on Amazon or Side Panel View on supplier website to check the brand or ASIN for IP alerts\n\nDone\n\nGet informed about the IP complaints or other product policy violations associated with the brand or ASIN\n\nIP ALERT EXTENSION\nIP-Alert Extension Review\n\nIn this video, we'll show you how to use IP-Alert Extension by Seller Assistant. What you'll learn: what is IP-Alert Extension, steps to install it, and steps to use it.\n\nEffortlessly detect IP complaints\n\nProactively avoid Amazon products and brands with intellectual property complaints. Seller Assistant marks high-risk products with a red triangle icon\n\nSource your products safely\n\nGet IP risk alerts wherever you research products. Seller Assistant's IP Alert appears when browsing Amazon listings, on search pages, in storefront views, as well as in the Side Panel View on supplier websites, helping you spot risky items early.\n\nIdentify potential product issues\n\nSee whether a product may have Amazon policy-related risks. Hover over the red triangle IP Alert icon in Seller Assistant to view available risk indicators directly during your research.\n\nInstantly update product risks\n\nStay aware of potential issues that may affect Amazon products. Seller Assistant highlights risk signals in real time, helping you avoid products that could cause problems.\n\nAutomate brand IP risk research\n\nGet automatic alerts for brands that have IP risks. Ensure you receive authorization to resell their products before sourcing.\n\nLearn More\nWHERE IT WORKS\nSupported Marketplaces\nCOM\nCA\nCOM.MX\nBR\nCO.UK\nDE\nFR\nES\nIT\nNL\nPL\nSE\nTR\nIN\nAE\nSA\nEG\nJP\nCOM.AU\nSG\nFrequently Asked Questions\nVisit Help Center\nWhat does Seller Assistant IP Alert do?\nWhere does Seller Assistant IP Alert appear?\nWhat data does Seller Assistant IP Alert show?\nWhat is the Seller Assistant IP Alert feature?\nHow does the Seller Assistant IP Alert feature work?\nAutomate IP complaint research\n\nReceive immediate IP warnings with Seller Assistant's IP-Alert® on Amazon product and search pages, and in the Side Panel View on supplier website. Preemptively avoid products that have Amazon IP complaints\n\nInstall for Chrome\n\nNot sure which plan fits your sourcing workflow? Chat with our team — we're happy to help.\n\nNAVIGATION\nHome\nPricing\nDownload\nSOLUTIONS\nOnline Arbitrage\nWholesale\nDropshipping\nAgencies\nPRODUCTS\nPrice List Analyzer\nLister\nPurchase Orders\nSuppliers\nWarehouses\nSeller Assistant Extension\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nVPN by Seller Assistant\nBulk Restriction Checker\nSeller Spy\nBrand Analyzer\nFREE TOOLS\nASIN Lookup\nIP-Alert Lookup\nSupplier Finder\nASIN to UPC\nUPC to ASIN\nEAN to ASIN\nFEATURES\nFBM & FBA Calculator\nVAT Calculator\nAmazon IP-Alert\nSide Panel View\nAmazon Quick View\nStorefront Widget\nAlerts & Flags\nRestrictions Checker\nSales Estimator\nOffers\nVariation Viewer\nStock Checker\nASIN Grabber\nSub-Accounts for VAs\nExport to Google Sheets\nNotes\nALTERNATIVES\nAnalyzer.Tools Alternative\nScan Unlimited Alternative\nSmartScout Alternative\nRevSeller Alternative\nBuyBotPro Alternative\nAZInsight Alternative\nSellerAmp Alternative\nIP-Alert Alternative\nDS Quick View Alternative\nPARTNERS\nAffiliate Program\nPartners\nAmazon Experts\nPress Kit\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nGet a Demo\nHelp Center\nOffice Hours\nNews & Updates\nProduct Roadmap\nReviews\nINTEGRATIONS\nZapier\nMake\nAirtable\nn8n\nGoogle Sheets\nSeller Central\nPrep Centers\nAPI\nOTHER LINKS\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nLANGUAGE\n🇬🇧 English\n🇷🇺 Русский\n🇪🇸 Español\n🇹🇷 Türkçe\n\nCopyright © 2019-2026 Linen Art, LLC. All rights reserved.\nAmazon and all related marks are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.\n\nTerms of Use\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nCookie Policy\n|\nRefund Policy"
